s9-3-p81 = prose (cons "A standalone export includes the selected runtime support and handlers or records their external contracts. C is the primary target presentation in this work. Its downstream compiler's relevant compilation relation is either an explicit dependency or supplied by a checked construction, as developed in §9.4. Correctness of a printer is a statement about the printed text's parsed meaning; a proof about its input tree does not make printing infallible." nil)
